            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Visualizza <code>sold_tickets</code>, ordina la lista e poi visualizzala di nuovo per vedere la differenza.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"sold_tickets = [\" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sold_tickets)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sold_tickets.sort()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sold_tickets)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"90\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[7, 20, 12, 30]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"[7, 12, 20, 30]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>print(sold_tickets)</code>, seguito da <code>sold_tickets.sort()</code> e infine <code>print(sold_tickets)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fai stampare al codice prima <code>[7, 20, 12, 30]</code> e poi <code>[7, 12, 20, 30]</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"sold_tickets = [\" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sold_tickets)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sold_tickets.sort()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sold_tickets)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"sold_tickets.pop()\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[7, 20, 12, 30]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"[7, 12, 20, 30]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>print(sold_tickets)</code>, seguito da <code>sold_tickets.sort()</code> e infine <code>print(sold_tickets)</code>.</p></body></html>",
